The Roof of the Inner Keep~
   You are standing on the roof, atop the highest point of the whole keep.  
The Great Desert lay spread out before you, and from this windswept position
you can see for miles.  You hear the cry of a bird, and look above to see
several vultures slowly winging their way toward the desolate deserts to the
south.  In this desert there is rumored to be a fantastic place filled with
wondrous treasures.    
